 "description": "Robinhood Chain as a whole. view: days (default; trades, volume, tokens, transactions, launches, ships per day), this-week, weekly-report (an ISO week, or the latest), unlocks (scheduled HoodLock unlocks with proof), build-market (Build Momentum beside market attention). Aggregates only; nobody is named.",
